### cat assigned before more words at the head of a pipeline
viewer=cat notes.txt | grep todo
>>> SC2209 1:1

### PAGER prefix set to bare cat before grep
PAGER=cat grep error app.log
>>> SC2209 1:1

### standalone assignment of pwd
here=pwd
echo "$here"
>>> SC2209 1:1

### value that is not a command name is fine
mode=fast ls -l
>>> none

### quoted command name is fine
PAGER="cat" grep error app.log
>>> none

### assigning the id command
user=id
echo "$user"
>>+ SC2209 1:1 -- id is a POSIX utility; shellcheck 0.11's list of common commands leaves it out

### a boolean string is a value
enabled=true
echo "$enabled"
>>> none
